# Hosts every sandbox may reach, one regular expression per line (proxy.mjs).
#
# Default deny: anything absent from this file — and from a Space's own list,
# set in that Space's settings — is refused. Anchor each entry (`^…$`) so
# `evil-pypi.org.attacker.com` cannot match the `pypi.org` line.
#
# The defaults are the package registries an agent needs to install what its
# script imports. Hosts one Space needs belong in that Space's settings; add
# here only what every Space may reach.

^(.+\.)?pypi\.org$
^(.+\.)?pythonhosted\.org$
^(.+\.)?npmjs\.org$
^(.+\.)?npmjs\.com$
^registry\.npmjs\.org$
^(.+\.)?bun\.sh$
^(.+\.)?astral\.sh$
